  "purpose": "Pinned SNESRecomp framework staged from the repository-owned source archive. UR-Recomp's permanent native build uses host SDL2, disables SDL3 source fetching, carries narrow project patches for exact neutral controller-stream replay and modern host integration, exposes the existing host-owned pause gate and live renderer VSync and desktop display-mode policy plus normalized active-monitor mode enumeration/application for modern product settings, adds an optional title-owned presentation-density callback for host-only HD composition, and exposes the framework's guest-frame APU timing lock needed by deterministic host-owned race restart.",
